{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p15871-dbabc97c97cf0e5d378b","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","text":"고맙습니다, 귀빈님. 당신은 이미 예언이 가리키는 목표를 얻었군요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 9","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2801195475624694165"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-e61c29b9d72cb6c589e5","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","text":"다른 곳에도 축복을 품은 약충이 있을 테니, 다른 의상공을 찾아가 보세요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 9","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6346149764172840365"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-97c8d7ad0e5975b563b3","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","text":"예언… 완료… 감사……","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 9","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17118220727787853563"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-00a75f8f9dca0299ab5d","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","text":"다른 곳… 도움 필요……","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 9","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1565092124095469696"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-2377af5e9b5e7d221788","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","text":"귀빈님, 이곳엔 더 이상 약충이 없어요——정말 굉장하시네요!","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 9","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16257229599880768515"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-9f1d7e6f2d586102eea3","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","text":"다른 곳에 수집하지 못한 약충이 있을 거예요. 괜찮다면 제 의상공 동료들을 도와주세요. 제가 대신 감사드릴게요, 손님!","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 9","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2633419643136705206"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p15871","title":"「의상공」","page":"「衣匠」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p15871-dbabc97c97cf0e5d378b","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-dbabc97c97cf0e5d378b","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","scene":"NPC 대사 9","contextId":"wiki-context-0198d8c111a3d1550e2d074e","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-e61c29b9d72cb6c589e5"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-e61c29b9d72cb6c589e5","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-e61c29b9d72cb6c589e5","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","scene":"NPC 대사 9","contextId":"wiki-context-0198d8c111a3d1550e2d074e","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[1,1],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-97c8d7ad0e5975b563b3","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-97c8d7ad0e5975b563b3","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"s3a0254d63d705b38","scene":"NPC 대사 9","contextId":"wiki-context-2c9dc22170af04a005763fea","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[4,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["ot